# Vendored, pre-resolved offline dependency caches (resources/java/README.md
# and resources/python/README.md explain what these are and how they're
# regenerated) — treated as opaque binary blobs, never subject to line-
# ending conversion. Several of these (.pom files especially) carry a paired
# .sha1 checksum computed against their original download bytes; letting
# core.autocrlf normalize them on checkout would silently change those
# bytes on a machine with autocrlf enabled, for no benefit (Maven doesn't
# actually need CRLF line endings, or care about them either way).
resources/java/m2repo/** -text
resources/python/wheels/** -text
resources/java/node-win-x64/** -text
